Suggests: nala
Description: Linux workstation dashboard
 Bender is a GTK4/libadwaita dashboard for the Linux desktop that wraps
 common system administration tasks into a tabbed GUI: system overview,
 security checks, network tools, maintenance actions (each asks before it
 runs), a weather forecast via ansiweather/OpenWeatherMap, and tinyproxy
 management.
 .
 Named after everyone's favourite bending unit from Futurama.
